To build we use CMake
make a build folder
use cmake with ninja:
```cmake .. -G Ninja```

To compile we use ninja:
```ninja```

TO make Language Server Protocal clangd understand every header / libary we need to include this into our CMakeLists.txt
```set(CMAKE_EXPORT_COMPILE_COMMANDS ON)```

TO make sure the flag is know for clangd we use this: 
``` export CLANGD_FLAGS="--compile-commands-dir=build" ```
this is done after we have compiled. 



